    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Document in folder:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'Resuscitation and Disposal Complex Regulations


        Note: Due
        to the current situation, all employees are required to strictly follow these
        instructions. Our delicate work has reached a new level, so everyone working
        directly with objects must complete the procedure themselves beforehand.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Step 1: Remove the object from the patient room.

        Step 2: Ensure
        the room and equipment are sterile.

        Step 3: Use the manipulators
        to grasp the object.

        Step 4: Clean the object, ensuring that blood,
        debris, bones in unsuitable areas, etc. are removed.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'Step 5: Use the manipulator to install the exoskeleton, being careful
        not to damage the object''s tissue.

        Step 6: Process and pack the
        object, trying to minimize contamination in the room.

        Step 7: Prepare
        the object for transfer to level 0 for core installation.

        We wish
        you good luck in your duties, employee.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'Note written in marker: "The last shift was fined for creating so-called
        dirt, which, of course, came to life and began to penetrate the ventilation,
        so be careful.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8396703910536335374, guid: c4a5bef15dc18d541bac6042da6a7c24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerComponentsToDisable.Array.data[0]'
