    - target: {fileID: 6251230858776747470, guid: c24574a12ba9d2941b14862ad28044c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: A scrap of newspaper, such cheap print, feels like it's from the last
        century.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6251230858776747470, guid: c24574a12ba9d2941b14862ad28044c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: '"COLLAPSE"

        According to experts, the planet will soon reach
        the outermost orbit in the solar system; no one can yet determine the cause
        of this; the world has lost contact with the rest of humanity, and will soon
        be encased in dark ice.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6251230858776747470, guid: c24574a12ba9d2941b14862ad28044c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'Don''t panic, there is a solution - universal servitorization.

        Know
        this: you will die while participating in this glorious demonstration of
        our power.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6251230858776747470, guid: c24574a12ba9d2941b14862ad28044c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerComponentsToDisable.Array.data[0]'
