    - target: {fileID: 7626337035250213626, guid: e33ede25ed40768488c7f6fef0712667, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[0]'
      value: WELCOME TO THE GAUS-215 COMPLEX
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7626337035250213626, guid: e33ede25ed40768488c7f6fef0712667, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: The poster is covered in marker, making it almost illegible.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7626337035250213626, guid: e33ede25ed40768488c7f6fef0712667, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'At the very bottom, written in the same marker, it reads:

        "To
        all new arrivals, the complex is under quarantine.

        Better save yourself.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7626337035250213626, guid: e33ede25ed40768488c7f6fef0712667, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'If you want to reach the lower levels, you must shut down the turret
        and unlock the elevator.

        Otherwise, you won''t be able to reach
        the lake."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7626337035250213626, guid: e33ede25ed40768488c7f6fef0712667, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerComponentsToDisable.Array.data[0]'
