    - target: {fileID: 1926445828233501768, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[0]'
      value: A note in the elevator room
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1926445828233501768, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: Some idiot blocked the elevator by activating the emergency security
        system.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1926445828233501768, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'He probably ran off to the lake himself. Anyway, the only way is to
        reboot the system (alliance detection) through the mainframe in the server
        room. Find the diskette, it''s labeled, we can''t do anything without it.


        -
        Security Officer K.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1926445828233501768, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
