    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Faded Journal

        "Path to the Stars"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: Some idiot blocked the elevator by activating the emergency security
        system.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'On their carbon shoulders, servitors pulled human civilization to the
        stars, giving birth to the modern order.


        - Historical background:
        One of the first human-colonized worlds brought a ray of enlightenment, revealing
        to humanity the secret of servitor creation.


        Only the best of the
        best: Each of them is as much a citizen of our state as any passerby; but
        only special training and skills helped them overcome all the difficulties
        of their transformation.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[3]'
      value: '- Outstanding and distinctive: You will easily recognize these heroes
        of labor by their spacesuits with glass helmets and segmented armor.


        -
        Have no doubt: each of them is the pinnacle of human technology, capable
        of surviving both in the vacuum of cold space and the scorching deserts of
        our colonies.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[4]'
      value: '-Join us: All inspired citizens are asked to fill out Form #1512 at
        the Bureau of Enlightenment.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6980505617597841709, guid: f4f0c64cb36d59e438ed9159fc73bb63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerComponentsToDisable.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
