    - target: {fileID: 8532242990402455736, guid: 89f762edeb54a1544a2920e85589d2fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[0]'
      value: Note in the server room
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8532242990402455736, guid: 89f762edeb54a1544a2920e85589d2fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[1]'
      value: The system is frozen and the data is lost. Find the diskette in the
        lab room; one of the eggheads must have snatched it for the terminal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8532242990402455736, guid: 89f762edeb54a1544a2920e85589d2fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[2]'
      value: It's pretty crowded there, but get it back to the mainframe, okay? Nothing
        will work without it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8532242990402455736, guid: 89f762edeb54a1544a2920e85589d2fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[3]'
      value: '- Administrator'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8532242990402455736, guid: 89f762edeb54a1544a2920e85589d2fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pages.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'Only the best of the best: Each of them is as much a citizen of our
        state as any passerby; but only special training and skills helped them overcome
        all the difficulties of their transformation.


        Outstanding and distinctive:
        You will easily recognize these heroes of labor by their spacesuits with
        glass helmets and segmented armor.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
